{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "14bd2eb1-7481-8a24-9b6b-fe7be75a8dca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T09:25:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:21:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:21:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Good morning. I want to put out a couch for the trash. An old couch. And I was told, um, I need to do something special for it, but nobody told me what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bulk item. Yeah, couches don't just go in with the regular pickup. Let me grab the screen here. Have you called about it before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I called Monday. No, wait. Tuesday. It was Tuesday, after the storm. The snow and then the rain, from Sunday into Monday. Somebody said a supervisor would call me back. Nobody called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So you were told a callback and it never came. Let me put that down. Do you remember who you talked to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. A man. He said somebody would call me by Wednesday. It is Thursday now. So I am calling again, and I am a little annoyed, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's fair. Okay, I'm noting it: couch, callback promised Wednesday, nothing yet. Can I get a number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four, zero, one. [pause] five, five, five. [pause] zero, one, eight, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:22:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine. Got it. And that's a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a cell. Please, I would like the supervisor to call me, not just a message. Somebody who can say what day the couch goes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll flag it for a supervisor to call you directly. Meanwhile, general rule, bulk items usually need to be scheduled ahead, and you don't want to just drop it at the curb or it can get tagged. So hold off putting it out until you hear a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because it is already in my garage, so it can wait. But I do not want it there for a month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Hopefully it's a quick call back. Is there anything else with the couch? Is it a regular sofa, nothing with a mattress pull-out or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just a regular couch. Three cushions. Gray. It is not a pull-out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three cushion gray couch, no pull-out. Good, I'll put that in the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Sorry, I am slow, I am writing it down also. My daughter just started driving lessons, so I am not so calm this week. I was in the car with her yesterday and my hands, they were like this on the seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Hang in there. Okay, so what I've got is a supervisor callback to the cell number, about scheduling the couch pickup, and a note that Tuesday's call didn't get returned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. When do you think they will call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise an hour, but I'm marking it so it goes on today's list, since it's already late. Should be sometime today, I'd hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today. I will keep my phone close. If nobody calls by tomorrow, I will call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, and you can mention you talked to Kevin this morning. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:25:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
